{"id":46438518481679,"type":"artist","name":"Sun City Girls","artist":null,"year":1981,"weight":20,"info":{"tags":["experimental","Avant-Garde","psychedelic","psychedelic folk","New Weird America"],"country":"US","begin":"1981","end":"2007","kind":"Group","similar":["Sir Richard Bishop","The Dead C","Thinking Fellers Union Local 282","The Residents","Hala Strana","Faust","The Red Krayola","Fred Frith","Six Organs of Admittance","Captain Beefheart & His Magic Band"],"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/e58cdbe47bcc9031d1079d6f94c348c7/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Agrupacion nacida a principios de los años 80´, Sun City Girls es algo asi como una banda underground de influencias arabigas , aunque ellos mismos desconocen este termino (banda), se autodenominan como un colectivo de ideas musicales, artisticas y filosoficas... Desconocidos para una gran mayoria, SCG transgreden por medio de sus canciones a la vez que conforman un proyecto interesante; tal vez la cancion mas conocida de estos sea \"The Shining Path\", claro que la recordaran..."},"works":[{"id":58171681861767,"type":"album","name":"Grotto Of Miracles","artist":"Sun City Girls","year":1986,"weight":6,"yt":"uJC1In9D1jw","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":111822577504847,"type":"album","name":"Torch Of The Mystics","artist":"Sun City Girls","year":1990,"weight":18,"yt":"x6CypaG5gqw","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":90391435651867,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1990","rank":175,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":1215,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":42512826448326,"name":"RYM Top — Psychedelia — Psychedelic Folk","rank":129,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":75688072598017,"type":"album","name":"330,003 Cross Dressers Fro