094006,"type":"genre","name":"Psychedelic Rock","n":1},{"id":79811058028299,"type":"genre","name":"Plunderphonics","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":246547991277401,"name":"Revival psicodélico y garage de los ochenta","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1982,"end":1996,"desc":"El revival más persistente de los ochenta y noventa. En Los Ángeles, el «Paisley Underground»: Rain Parade, Three O'Clock, Dream Syndicate (síntesis de Dylan y la Velvet), Savage Republic, True West, Opal. En la Costa Este, los imitadores fetichistas (Lyres, Fuzztones, Chesterfield Kings) y bandas creativas (Das Damen, Plasticland, Eleventh Dream Day). El garage más crudo: Honeymoon Killers, Gibson Bros, Gories, Original Sins, God Bullies, Pandoras. La psicodelia libre de jams: Crystallized Movements, Magic Hour, Vocokesh, Sun City Girls, Black Sun Ensemble, Helios Creed. En Australia, Celibate Rifles, Died Pretty, Hoodoo Gurus, Beasts Of Bourbon, Scientists, Feedtime, Crime And The City Solution; en Europa, Hanoi Rocks, Echo & The Bunnymen, Teardrop Explodes, Bevis Frond, Legendary Pink Dots, The The y Love And Rockets.","color":"#c084fc","family":"Psicodelia, garage y shoegaze","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#psych-revival"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":58171681861767,"artist":"Sun City Girls","artist_id":46438518481679,"title":"Grotto Of Miracles","year":1986,"ess":0,"yt":"uJC1In9D1jw","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Revival psicodélico y garage de los ochenta","scene_id":246547991277401,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#psych-revival","chapters":["Sección 5.14"],"pages":[[1,172,null]]},{"id":111822577504847,"artist":"Sun City Girls","artist_id":46438518481679,"title":"Torch Of The Mystics","year":1990,"ess":1,"yt":"x6CypaG5gqw","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History